msgid "Ethical Considerations and Data Protection Principles"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/overview.md:50
msgid "In addition to verifying and validating COVID-19 certificates, a global digital health trust network such as the GDHCN can:"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/overview.md:29
msgid "In response to COVID-19, Governments and organizations across the world have developed and adopted standards and technologies to create, present, and verify digital vaccination and test credentials. However, a global technical framework to enable convenient use and interoperability of these credentials between systems – while also allowing domestic autonomy over their use – does not exist yet and is critically needed."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/overview.md:97
msgid "Issuers that provide verifiable health credentials to individuals, Verifiers that consume verifiable health credentials provided by individuals, and Trust Networks that establish trust relationships and policies between issuers and verifiers."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/overview.md:81
msgid "On Friday, September 29, 2023, WHO’s Director General sent a circular letter to all Member States encouraging participation in the GDHCN."
msgstr ""

